abstract: "AEGIS-NTRO is an air-gapped, sovereign, citation-native network compliance auditing system designed for national research and defense infrastructures. It evaluates multi-vendor network configurations using hybrid dense/sparse retrieval within PostgreSQL and GBNF-grammar-constrained LLM reasoning."
